  "_comment": [
    "VenueLayout, a seating layout owned by its creator (docs/commerce_PRD.md §4.11, D8, D32). Created and copied by",
    "POST /spark/ticketing/venues/layouts/create|copy, edited in the layout editor (ng-spark ticketing/venues), published",
    "through Approvals (kind ticketing-venues.layout-publish). Only Name is a form field; renaming is a proposal (modify).",
    "The plans are VenueLayoutPlan documents beside it, never attributes (a 50k-seat plan is megabytes).",
    "",
    "HAND-AUTHORED. Ids are UUIDv5 of 'ticketing-venues:VenueLayout[...]', written by 'npm run stamp:library-model-ids'."
  ],
